          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Orange stealth wheels",
          "basis": "team",
          "src": [
            "s14",
            "s13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Motors sit far back on the arm, which lowers the center of gravity and arm inertia",
          "basis": "team",
          "src": [
            "s14"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "An undated published commit, which includes demo modes, has a tunable left shooting speed with default",
          "basis": "team",
          "src": [
            "s16"
          ],
          "value": 5066,
          "unit": "rpm"
        },
        {
          "text": "An undated published commit, which includes demo modes, has a tunable right shooting speed with default",
          "basis": "team",
          "src": [
            "s16"
          ],
          "value": 7733,
          "unit": "rpm"
        },
        {
          "text": "A build-thread post that reads as the team's says it mounts on the inside face of the arm tube, so an assembled spare drops in",
          "basis": "observer",
          "src": [
            "s13"
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "A build-thread post that reads as the team's says 0.75 in beater bars take hard hits",
